bottomparticipants

actor User
control Other Service
control NotificationService
database MongoDB
control Firebase

User -> Other Service: 1. sendNotification(notification)
activate User
activate Other Service
Other Service -> NotificationService: 2. createNotification(noti)
activate NotificationService

NotificationService -> MongoDB: 3. insert notification (noti.save)
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> NotificationService: 4. saved
deactivate MongoDB

NotificationService -> NotificationService: 5. Get device id
activate NotificationService
space
deactivate NotificationService
opt No tokens
  NotificationService --> Other Service: 5.1 {successTokens:[], failedTokens:[]}
  Other Service --> User: 5.2 return empty result
end

NotificationService -> Firebase: 6. sendEachForMulticast(tokens,title,body)
activate Firebase
Firebase --> NotificationService: 7. successCount/failureCount + per-token results
deactivate Firebase
NotificationService -> NotificationService: 8. Build successTokens/failedTokens
activate NotificationService
space
deactivate NotificationService
NotificationService --> Other Service: 9.1 Return delivery result
deactivate NotificationService
Other Service --> User: 9.2 return send result
deactivate Other Service
deactivate User